  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSO support in Serbia BOS 2016-2023 - BOS Serbia 2016-2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">civila samh&#xe4;llet i Serbien BOS 2016-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the CS4EU Programme is to support and enhance EU integration related reforms in Serbia through an advanced role of civil society organisations and media. The role of civil society is essential for promotion and establishment of rule of law and human rights protection, i.e. fulfilment of Copenhagen criteria for EU accession. Through the Programme CSOs and media will be supported to act as advocates of citizens interests in decision-making process and the EU accession negotiation. The programme aims to contribute to CSOs democratic capacities and strengthen CSOs and media for greater impact on society during the EU accession process.

The objectives of the intervention have not changed and the intervention continues to supports SDG 16: Promote peaceful and inclusive societies for sustainable development, provide access to justice for all and build effective, accountable and inclusive institutions at all levels&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisationen Belgrade Open School (BOS), Serbien har hos Sida ans&#xf6;kt om 15 miljoner kronor f&#xf6;r finansiering av programmet &quot;CS4EU-Civil Society as a Force for a Change in the Serbia&apos;s EU Accession Process&quot; under perioden 2016-2019. Insatsen syftar till att ge det civila samh&#xe4;llets organisationer m&#xf6;jlighet att ta aktiv del i Serbiens EU-process.

Programmets totala budget &#xe4;r 15 miljoner kronor. Cirka 7,5 miljoner kronor (3 omg&#xe5;ngar x 15 bidrag, core och projekt st&#xf6;d) av programmets budget kommer att vidarebefordras fr&#xe5;n organisationen BOS till serbiska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer.

Det &#xe4;r Sidas bed&#xf6;mning att det f&#xf6;reslagna programmet &#xe4;r i linje med Sveriges Resultatstrategi f&#xf6;r reformsamarbete med &#xd6;steuropa, V&#xe4;stra Balkan och Turkiet f&#xf6;r perioden 2014-2020 och att programmet b&#xf6;r bidra till civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationers potential att skapa m&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r att p&#xe5;verka samh&#xe4;llsutveckling och EU-n&#xe4;rmande med dess v&#xe4;rdegrund.

Insatsen kommer att bidra till ett effektiv operationalisering av Resultatstrategi avseende Strategi Resultat R8 under strategiperioden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">efficient operalisation of the Results Strategy and Strategy Result   R8 in the strategy period</narrative>
  </description>
